  m_text: "<color=#FF3020>CREATED BY:</color>\nRobert Lawrence\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>DESIGN,
    PROGRAMMING & 3D MODELS:</color>\nRobert Lawrence\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>CHARACTER
    & LOGO ART:</color>\nRobert Lawrence\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>SOUND EFFECTS</color>\nPixabay
    (pixabay.com)\nAdditional sounds made in jsfxr\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>MUSIC</color>\r\n\"Waltz
    of the Carnies,\" \"Lobby Time,\" \"Meatball Parade,\"\r\n\"Grand Le Chase,\"
    \"Pixel Peeker Polka - faster,\" \"Space Fighter Loop,\"\r\n\"Balloon Game\"\r\nKevin
    MacLeod (incompetech.com)\r\nLicensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution
    4.0\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>FONTS:</color>\nDSEG by keshikan (SIL Open Font License)\nLucasArts
    SCUMM Solid by Goatmeal (CC BY-NC-SA, FontStruct)\n\n\n<color=#FF3020>TEXTURES
    & IMAGES:</color>\nGoogle\n\n\n<i><color=#AAAAAA>\"Thanks for playing, friend.
    The boardwalk's always open.\" \n- Curly</color></i>"
